--- !u!114 &1893444546
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1893444545}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 42a29360420148049b8a16f6bd7bdd85, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  loreList:
  - Hello. My name is Rick Harrison. I am writing this note because I have awoken
    in this unfamiliar place, and I am not sure there is a way to leave. I have been
    here for what feels like a couple of days now and there is still no end in sight.
    It seems like I am the only person in this strange place at the moment. I hope
    someone else finds this note and can come help me. I will leave more notes as
    I discover more things about this place.
  - 'Rick''s Log: Day 5. I keep going deeper and deeper. The deeper I go the larger
    the floors seem to get. I''ve already lost count of how many floors I have gone
    down, which probably isn''t great if I''m planning to be rescued... Plus, I can
    feel a bit of my sanity slipping every time I find one of those ladders. I have
    to escape this place.'
  - 'Rick''s Log: Day 16. I have been here for longer than I had hoped. It seems
    there is no escaping this place. I hope someone finds this note and can come
    rescue me before one of those "things" gets me. I''m beginning to lose all hope
    of leaving here alive.'
  - 'Rick''s Log: Day 18. Stay away from the TVs!! I was unfortunate enough to go
    near one and it was clearly messing with my head. Even now I can''t get the static
    out of my imagination. I would be better off never encountering another one of
    those things again.'
  - 'Rick''s Log: Day 21. I found an oddly pristine looking compass on the ground.
    When I picked it up, a strange red light emerged from it and hovered around,
    almost like it was guiding me. I followed it, and it lead me to another ladder!
    It seems even in this hostile environment there are some helpful entities around.
    I hope I find more things like this.'
  - 'Rick''s Log: Day 24 (I think?). I had another encounter with one of the creatures
    that live here. This time it was one of those giant black spider-like creatures.
    They only have 4 legs though, and oddly large heads. I think I will call them
    "Crawlers". I was able to avoid being noticed by it for a while, but it eventually
    saw me. They seem to be attracted to loud sounds, because as soon as I dropped
    a stack of boxes to try and block it, the crawler went after the boxes instead
    of me. I was able to escape because of that and I am thankfully uninjured.'
  - Ric log 29. I'm starting to see lots of creetures. I find myself forget werds
    but I still remeber my name is Ric. I need to leave now.
  - 'Rick''s Log: Day 30. I got so hungry that I ended up eating some pills I found
    on a dusty office desk. This was for the better surprisingly, because after I
    ate them it felt like a heavy haze had been lifted off my head. Almost like I
    snapped out of something. I am feeling more like who I was when I entered this
    place. I have to make sure I can find more of those pills for the future.'
